  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>재과만 선생님들 도움만 받아와서..<br>주말에 다읽고 감명 받은(?!) 기상학 관련 책이 넘 좋아서 공유해봐요^^<br><br><br>기상학 관련 책 한권을 꼽으라면<br>저는 단언컨대 이 책입니다^^<br><br><br>책을 읽고 채운에 대해서도 잘 이해하게 되었네요~<br><br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/musesoul74/223798146026\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">무지갯빛 구름은 모두 채운</a>?<br>(채운 Irisation, 彩雲 Iridescent cloud)<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/932e513ef064d478d93538afc8065dd4ae2e8fd9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/932e513ef064d478d93538afc8065dd4ae2e8fd9\" data-origin-width=\"1079\" data-origin-height=\"652\"><div class=\"figcaption\">출처 책저자 인스타그램</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0e0513209bfee599f89b97d1ca68b912266576d9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0e0513209bfee599f89b97d1ca68b912266576d9\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"804\"><div class=\"figcaption\">출처 책저자 인스타그램</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9421d6cca19a2aa28057d9f65ee4dc180735c07f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9421d6cca19a2aa28057d9f65ee4dc180735c07f\" data-origin-width=\"1077\" data-origin-height=\"1653\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/musesoul74/223797256895\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><br></a> </p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
